H.\ce{K2Cr2O7}
I.\ce{K2CrO4}
J.\ce{KI}
K.\ce{KMnO4}
L.\ce{NH4OH}
M.\ce{Na2CO3}
N.\ce{Na2SO4}
O.\ce{Na2S}
P.\ce{Pb(NO3)2}
Select all best-scoring options.
answer:

